      "title": "<i>EXPGUI</i>, a graphical user interface for<i>GSAS</i>",
      "abstract": "<jats:p>A description and justification of the<jats:italic>EXPGUI</jats:italic>program is presented. This program implements a graphical user interface and shell for the<jats:italic>GSAS</jats:italic>single-crystal and Rietveld package. Use of the Tcl/Tk scripting language allows<jats:italic>EXPGUI</jats:italic>to be platform independent. Also included is a synopsis of how the program is implemented.</jats:p>",
